<title>USA: Flowserve Corp begins on NYSE, stock surges.</title>
<headline>Flowserve Corp begins on NYSE, stock surges.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Flowserve Corp surged more than 50 percent at their debut on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shares of the industrial flow management company, formed by the merger of BW/IP Inc and Durco International Inc, rose 12-1/4 to 36-1/8. The stock was the top gainer on the New York Stock Exchange on a percent basis.</p>
</text>
